  - The six tiles, exact order / stat / decimals / unit / icon / accent:
      1 Top Speed          speed.max  km/h→display 0dp  speedUnit  speedometer            cyan
      2 Avg Speed          speed.avg  km/h→display 0dp  speedUnit  chart.line.uptrend     purple
      3 Peak Power         power.max  kW           0dp  "kW"       bolt.fill              amber
      4 Peak Regen         regen.max  kW           0dp  "kW"       battery.100.bolt       green
      5 Avg Drive Distance distance.avg km→display 1dp distUnit    mappin.and.ellipse     cyan
      6 Longest Drive      distance.max km→display 1dp distUnit    car.fill               purple
  - Conversions ported verbatim: fromKmh(kmh)=convertSpeedFromSI(kmh*1000/3600),
